{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2018-04", "window": 4, "start_date": 1524528000, "end_date": 1525132799, "month_true_total": 74, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:50:55 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "41779091", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993966741", "personaname": "ChesterCC", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197993966741/", "num_games_owned": 176, "num_reviews": 61, "playtime_forever": 780, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 647, "last_played": 1526658750, "avatar": "1c0b5c37a442a2d39f32902ec42f2e26ba6a142e"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "有意思  如果枪的射击感能更好就好了", "timestamp_created": 1525112991, "timestamp_updated": 1525112991, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41776943", "author": {"steamid": "76561198146747276", "personaname": "Mrkwtkr", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mrcoffeetalker/", "num_games_owned": 110, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 31227, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2138, "last_played": 1739885409, "avatar": "c3ed3d0463a3ebea94a91ccd5741ab0310bae434"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "Deep Rock Galactic是由Ghost Ship Games开发的多人合作科幻风FPS游戏，发行于2018年2月28日，目前好评率91%，同时在线玩家的历史峰值为4295，当前游戏拥有者90973名。\n\n核心玩法：FPS+冒险，最多4人组成的小队在黑暗的地下世界中采集资源，与外星虫群战斗\n\n实际玩法：三维立体迷宫找路，跳舞嗨皮，踢油桶\n\n目前游戏时间16小时，如果你是被宣传视频吸引并且兴趣较强的，可以考虑入手试玩，但务必注意，游戏当前的深度还不足以支撑长期的耐玩性，目测游戏时长不超过一周即可毕业。\n\n\n[b] 优点 [/b]\n[list]\n    [*]地图100%可破坏\n    [*]爽快的打击感\n    [*]个性鲜明的四种职业，依赖团队配合\n    [*]死亡惩罚轻，挫败感弱\n    [*]单人游戏提供辅助机器人（协助挖掘与战斗）\n    [*]“黑暗场景+照明探路”设计新颖，氛围营造良好\n    [*]矿骡自动寻路真实度高\n    [*]直接与场景结合的功能入口\n    [*]准备场景（飞船）中的消遣玩法（油桶、播放器、失重按钮）\n\n[/list]\n\n[b] 缺点 [/b]\n[list]\n    [*]后期重复性较强，游戏深度和耐玩性不足\n    [*]职业互补过于明显，人数不足/选择不均时难度显著提升\n    [*]不同职业的特殊能力未做引导介绍\n    [*]部分地形复杂度较高，各种垂直蜿蜒结构容易迷路\n    [*]M键小地图识别困难，帮助不大\n    [*]队友、矿骡状态需要Ctrl才能查看，并非常驻UI\n    [*]缺乏游戏内独立的好友系统\n    [*]外观装饰有限，风格接受度存疑\n    [*]无法自由旋转查看角色外观\n    [*]每次重启游戏需要重新设置语言选项\n    [*]缺乏整合功能入口的UI（选择角色、升级装备、选择地图等）\n[/list]\n\n看目前官方更新还是比较勤快的，可以期待一下后续的新内容", "timestamp_created": 1525104811, "timestamp_updated": 1525104811, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41773063", "author": {"steamid": "76561198137678281", "personaname": "吧唧", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198137678281/", "num_games_owned": 189, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 13146, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1597, "last_played": 1722966270, "avatar": "3e510296bf58724a35b53b16f32881bb813bd1ff"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "除了没人开黑其他都好", "timestamp_created": 1525089593, "timestamp_updated": 1525089593, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41772692", "author": {"steamid": "76561198241489286", "personaname": "罐装啤酒", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jiangmingxi/", "num_games_owned": 229, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 2094, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 350, "last_played": 1624505190, "avatar": "3f5e9daea59216d7fe13df4e